Compiler                clang++
Assembly                %_FileName%%32
Type                    static_lib
Source.Files            microsoft_craziness.cpp
Includes                ../../
Compiler.Flags          -Os -Wno-writable-strings -nostdlib -nostdlib++
Defines                 RIFT_STATIC
BuildDirectory          ../Windows
IntermediateDirectory   ../../../Intermediate/microsoft_craziness
Assert.WorkingDirectory .

if 32 
{
    Compiler.Flags -m32
    Linker.Flags   --target=i386-pc-windows-msvc 
}
